+ *   escalated to a reset instead.
+ * ``-EPROTO``: a FAST_REQUEST H2G got a reply that is neither a rejection nor
+ *   a valid response type.
  * ``-EOPNOTSUPP``: G2H carried an HXG type this driver does not handle.
